{"id":9061,"chapter_id":9,"scene_id":907,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"一曲终了，尖锐的声音让你晕头转向。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"？？","content":"怎么样，清醒点没？我的唢呐无人争锋，听了果然神清气爽满面春风吧～","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"？？","content":"刚刚这首价值10000狄斯币，来，买单～","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"选项","options":["你是禁闭者？"],"jump":[6],"style":6,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"？？","content":"哎呀别岔开话题！跟禁闭者有什么关系，我是你的救命恩人，主动点把账结了吧～","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"？？","content":"还是说……你想对我用那个红色的尖刺，你想——赖账？！","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"！她知道枷锁？你的身份暴露了吗？","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"选项","options":["我不想伤到你","我不知道你在说什么"],"jump":[10,12],"style":6,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"？？","content":"哈哈哈哈哈哈！骗人，你只是不敢跟流民寨彻底撕破脸。","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"？？","content":"哈哈哈哈哈哈真会装！你不是要来跟流民寨交好的吗？这么没诚意可不行哦！","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"？？","content":"我知道你在想什么——“这儿只有她一个人，没人知道我干了什么，我想怎么做都行……用权能轰飞盖子，对她使用枷锁吧！”","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061012"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"通过枷锁能感应到禁闭者们已经越来越近。你不再被她的小把戏牵着走，开始反过来拖延时间。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"选项","options":["你从哪儿知道我的事？"],"jump":[16],"style":6,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"？？","content":"嗯哼……我全知全能，过去未来天上地下无所不知无所不晓！","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061015"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"？？","content":"你刚醒来没多久，破坏了BR-004，消灭了受骸者，也干掉了军团两个头目。","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061016"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"选项","options":["我不是军团的敌人"],"jump":[19],"style":6,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"他们是我的朋友。我想救他们，失败了。可我不想再失败第二次。","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我来阻止那些企图伤害辛迪加的人，我不是你们的敌人。","style":2,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"speaker":"？？","content":"嗯哼……这我也知道。","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061020"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"？？","content":"军团不恨你，在他们眼中，你是朋友，是个好人，你已经尽力了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061021"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"content":"她这话说出口竟有些温柔。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"选项","options":["……是谁告诉你的？"],"jump":[25],"style":6,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"content":"那个声音凑近了，隔着冰冷的木板像是在触碰你的手，轻声呢喃。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"speaker":"？？","content":"他们亲口说的……这是他们留给这世界的最后的信息……想知道他们都说了什么吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061025"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"speaker":"？？","content":"这条路稳稳地托住你，在漫天灰烬中向前奔去。","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061026"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"speaker":"选项","options":["你究竟是……"],"jump":[29],"style":6,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"speaker":"？？","content":"好啦好啦，我不会再说什么了，你不结账就休想从我嘴里听到任何一个字。不，说，啦～","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061028"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"speaker":"？？","content":"哎呦——！","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061029"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"content":"她正乐呵着，一声轰鸣，随即呼啦一声，有什么东西被吹飞，乒铃乓啷一顿滚。","style":3,"background":922,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"content":"你感到木板突然轻了，轻松推开，坐了起来，并不明亮的光线却晃晕了你的眼睛。与此同时，你听到熟悉的声音——","style":3,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"局长！","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061032"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"content":"梦魇托着赫卡蒂，径直从高处跃下，拦在你和那个被撞到一边的人之间。你松了一口气。","style":3,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"speaker":"选项","options":["海拉呢？"],"jump":[36],"style":6,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"她中了机关，被困住了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061035"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"不用担心，她没事。等解决这里，我会回去帮她解开束缚的。","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061036"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"content":"跌坐木匣旁边的，是一个装束怪异的少女，她揉着脑袋爬起来，手里还抓着一个怪异的乐器。","style":3,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":39,"speaker":"怪异的少女","content":"唔啊——怎么这么凶啊，我不就跟他开个玩笑吗？","female_content":"唔啊——怎么这么凶啊，我不就跟她开个玩笑吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061038","vo_cgplot_9061038f"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":40,"speaker":"怪异的少女","content":"我也不想真的打架，我很弱的。就是喜欢凑热闹而已，别生气好不好？","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061039"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":41,"speaker":"怪异的少女","content":"不是说要跟流民寨好好谈谈吗？我帮你呀～","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061040"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":42,"speaker":"选项","options":["我没有生气","我懒得跟你谈"],"jump":[43,45],"style":6,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":43,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"但计划有变，现在的我必须隐藏身份。而你知道得太多了，禁闭者。","style":2,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":45,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你知道得太多，做得也太过火了，禁闭者。","style":2,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":46,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"要抓捕她吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061045"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":47,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"能戴上枷锁就行。我没办法信任她，只能要她闭嘴了。","style":2,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":48,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"明白。","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061047"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":49,"speaker":"怪异的少女","content":"哈哈，谈不拢就开始耍流氓了？这样可不行！","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061048"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":50,"content":"她猛地一吹手中的乐器，刺耳的音波竟一时击退了进攻的梦魇，回响在这高耸的天井之中。","style":3,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":51,"content":"你跟赫卡蒂一时都有些发麻。回声迟迟没有消退——不，这不是持续的回响，而是从四面八方涌出来的人们。你赶紧脱下管理局外套揣在怀里。","style":3,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":52,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"……是流民寨的武装？！我们被发现了吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061051"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":53,"content":"她一歪身子，躲过一个从楼上旋转飞来的平底锅。","style":3,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":54,"speaker":"居民","content":"吵死人啦！！做着饭瓦煲都被震碎了！","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061053"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":55,"speaker":"居民","content":"嘟嘟你这臭丫头又在搞什么鬼！？","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061054"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":56,"content":"被称为嘟嘟的少女嘻嘻笑着。","style":3,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":57,"speaker":"嘟嘟","content":"抓我？也不想想这里是哪儿。这可是我的地盘。","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061056"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":58,"content":"她突然仰着脖子大喊——","style":3,"background":910,"log_type":1},{"step":59,"speaker":"嘟嘟","content":"救命呀——有入侵者啦！！入侵者偷袭流民寨啦！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_9061058"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_0906","style":1,"background":910,"log_type":1}]}